Suddenly, Doyle grabs your shoulder and sinks silently to the ground. His face turns pale, his eyes roll up. You barely manage to hold him, and he collapses in your arms.
"Doyle, Doyle!" you slap him on the cheeks, trying to revive your friend.
At least you see that he is alive; you can hear him breathing and wheezing slightly. You put him down carefully and think desperately about what to do.